 "iteration_rule": "internal early stopping on train-range days (UTC day % 10 == 0); holdout and forward refit on all train-range rows with iterations x 1.1; test (full 2025) uses the same iterations x 1.1 (--full_mult 1.0) | artmm: p_art cell means moved by kappa x (carrier-month arrival copy share minus its training-month share) where that change is at least 0.10; kappa from training-month cells only; threshold fixed in research | arthist: LIRF non-G p_art moved in log-odds by beta x (flight-history art share vs the flight-month mean p_art); one coefficient beta fitted on the val ruler rows (day folds for val, January for fwd, both months for test) | gkey: G model refit per setting on the g_band training rows (2025 months outside the evaluated ones); key average 0.5 and the nine columns fixed in research, nothing chosen on the ruler | gkeyx: G model refit per setting on the g_band training rows; twelve record columns, the 43,200 s d_sch guard and the 0.5 key average fixed in research, nothing chosen on the ruler | gkeyxn (avg_xncr): G model refit per setting on the g_band training rows; the nine R3 stand and link columns and the carrier-month arrival copy share added to gkeyx's twelve on the GBM side, gkeyx's 43,200 s d_sch guard and 0.5 key average kept, nothing chosen on the ruler | aiu_shift: no model fitting; g and the airport offsets come from ruler months outside the moved rows | antiwin: no fitting; c and m are medians over 2025 months outside the evaluated months | gpool: G class probabilities = log pool of the four G components with one exponent a, fitted by 3-class log loss on component probabilities from G models without the row's month (val: nested over the 10 training months, fwd: over Jan-Jun, full: the 12 leave-one-month-out probabilities)",
